From 0df9d928045545f0ff409bcfed4f04979ca17920 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Try Omarchy Release <actions@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 01:30:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Deliver dropped files into the guest window under the drop
 point

Add try-omarchy-drop, which resolves the Hyprland window under a point, focuses
it, puts the file list on the clipboard as text/uri-list, and pastes it. The
guest agent accepts a drop request from the launcher and reports whether it was
delivered, so the launcher can fall back to the transfer window. Ships through
compatibility revision 25.
